{"id":140233909,"slug":"its-a-wonderful-scam","title":"It's a Wonderful Scam","subtitle":"A New Year's Eve Miracle ","post_date":"2024-01-01T00:21:18.080Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/its-a-wonderful-scam","wordcount":356,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:55:16.551Z","body_sha256":"1dc53713f08b2e4cf2cbb7d36cabf13a3400d5f576ba236fa21f52a5e98fadd2","text_words":363,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>Earlier today, <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/top-scam-messages-of-2023?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">I wrote an article</a> about ♥️ My Love ♥️ of scammers.  </p><p>I dictated that, and it inserted a heart emoji.  </p><p>I'm gonna keep them because it's that kind of New Year's Eve.</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share The Frontier Psychiatrists &quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share\"><span>Share The Frontier Psychiatrists </span></a></p><p>I'm about to go out to dinner with my wife, which you do for New Year's Eve when you're 44.  And if you've been <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/so-youve-been-cyber-stalked-a-hidden\">relentlessly stalked</a> for <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/so-someone-has-been-threatening-your\">years</a> like me!  <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/fighting-back-against-stalkers-defamation\">I like to keep a low profile on New Year's Eve 2024</a>.  However, I got the following message on <a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/linkedin-unlocked-discover-how-i\">LinkedIn</a> just a few moments ago and had to share it with you, my dear readers!  I’m kind of a big deal on LinkedIn…<a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/linkedin-unlocked-discover-how-i\">Just look at my articles about my engagement rate deconstructing!</a>  Someone noticed. “Her” name?  Anna…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!xzt5!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F4e4d5f66-77bc-4780-b413-5b532776d4dc_1290x645.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" h