g xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Oh my.  My dearest Anna, you should probably read my messages.  I'm going to notice if you don't!  I might even write a whole article about it. Oh my God, the satire is coming from within the house!  It's happening right now, Anna. </p><p>Alas, scammers and sarcasm are mutually exclusive.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Vsd!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0897e8ed-8ebd-44c2-befd-a6ddeab8f438_1290x590.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Vsd!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0897e8ed-8ebd-44c2-befd-a6ddeab8f438_1290x590.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Vsd!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0897e8ed-8ebd-44c2-befd-a6ddeab8f438_1290x590.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Vsd!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0897e8ed-8ebd-44c2-befd-a6ddeab8f438_1290x590.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9Vsd!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good